 R←Test_Misc_011(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;pairs;expected
⍝ Exercise `SplitNames` and `MaskIniValues`
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 →T.PassesIf(,⊂'X-MY-TOKEN')≡##.Plodder.SplitNames'x-my-token'
 →T.PassesIf((,'A')'B-C')≡##.Plodder.SplitNames' a , b-c,'
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢##.Plodder.SplitNames''

 pairs←('Port' 8080)('DBPassword' 'geheim')('PrivateKeyFile' 'x.pem')('Api_Key' 'abc')
 expected←('Port' 8080)('DBPassword' '***')('PrivateKeyFile' 'x.pem')('Api_Key' '***')
 →T.PassesIf expected≡##.Plodder.SecretIniKeys ##.Plodder.MaskIniValues pairs
 →T.PassesIf(0⍴⊂'')≡##.Plodder.SecretIniKeys ##.Plodder.MaskIniValues 0⍴⊂''

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
